24,2,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
25,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Wow, setting up every morning takes way longer than I thought. And those shuffles are a total mess!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The costs are quite rigid. We pay for the area regardless of how many people are actually sitting there.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems the window seats are highly coveted, but our arrival times are all over the place.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The noise levels vary significantly, and getting a chair right takes days. Stability is key.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Overhearing things is actually how people learn here. Proximity really drives the work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Rin,,"If we change seats too often, we'll just be living in boxes for weeks.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Also, every time we move a desk, the facilities charge us a fee per desk.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"If we go with a first-come basis, the late arrivals will always get the worst spots.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Shion,,"Exactly. If I have to reset my monitor and chair every day, my back will give out.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"But if we are too separated, we lose that natural knowledge sharing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,pass,Rin,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We need a balance between cost and flexibility.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,We can't ignore the fairness of the seating.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Shion,,I'm leaning toward something permanent.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"I agree, as long as we are grouped smartly.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
