50,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Free Address sounds exciting, but the setup time and the chaos of shuffles make me nervous.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Rotating Blocks would be a financial drain due to the repeated facilities quotes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,Free Address is unfair to those arriving at ten. Fixed Desks by Function seems more equitable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Shion,,Fixed Desks is the only way to ensure the sound and ergonomics are settled.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Fixed Desks by Function would keep the right people together for the best communication.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Rin,,I guess Fixed Desks is the safest bet for my schedule too.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Toshio,,It's the most budget-friendly option in the long run.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. Let's avoid the ""luck of the draw"" with the windows.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Shion,,It's the logical choice for physical comfort.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm all for it!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
